  "prefLabel": "Rev 2207.04 Form MS-45, Financial Report of the County",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2207.04 Form MS-45, Financial Report of the County. Form MS-45, “Financial Report of the County”, shall be completed and filed pursuant to RSA 21-J:34, V, and RSA 28:3 by the clerk for the board of commissioners to report the financial status of the county to the department.\n\nSource. #9486, eff 6-23-09 (formerly Rev 2208.02); ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2208.04); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
